<h1 id=3D"ArchitectureTemplate-Feature">Feature</h1>
<p><em><span data-colorid=3D"laok9pu371">URL/Link to feature in Rally</span=
></em></p>
<h1 id=3D"ArchitectureTemplate-Summary">Summary</h1>
<p><em><span data-colorid=3D"u7zmp64mfc">Brief summary of the requirements =
and solution (or solution options).</span></em></p>
<p><em><span data-colorid=3D"a5udml36mk">Could link out to any documentatio=
n from analysts or PMs.</span></em></p>
<h1 id=3D"ArchitectureTemplate-Milestones">Milestones</h1>
<p><em><span data-colorid=3D"q5xlyxuk8o">Below milestone descriptions are j=
ust examples - please add/remove these depending upon what this feature req=
uires.</span></em></p>
