<h1 id=3D"ArchitectureTemplate-Discovery">Discovery</h1>
<p><em><span data-colorid=3D"t55votpqjb">If there are multiple options - de=
scribe each one with pros/cons. Indicate chosen direction. These should not=
 be too in depth. Just high level depiction of options. Sometimes there are=
 not multiple options - in that case just document early discovery aspects.=
</span></em></p>
